Third-party code included in this repository
=============================================

The following top-level files are adapted from the official implementation of
"Grokking at the Edge of Numerical Stability" (Prieto, Barsbey, Mediano and Birdal, 2025;
https://github.com/LucasPrietoAl/grokking-at-the-edge-of-numerical-stability), which is
distributed under the MIT License reproduced below:

    binary_operations.py  constants.py  datasets.py  grokking_experiments.py
    logger.py  models.py  orthograd.py  utils.py

The MLP architecture, the StableMax cross-entropy loss (utils.stablemax_cross_entropy) and the
AdamW configuration used by tools/train_topology.py come from these files.

